==English==
[[File:Cetorhinus maximus by greg skomal.JPG|thumb|A basking shark]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A very large [[shark]], {{taxlink|Cetorhinus maximus|species|noshow=1|ver=160930}}, that feeds at or close to the surface by filtering [[plankton]] from the water and is found in all the world's temperate oceans.

